%% STATUS: TARGET (proposed, not implemented)
sequenceDiagram
  actor C as Caller
  participant V as Voice UI
  participant API as Calls API
  participant DB as Postgres
  participant PC as Post-call worker
  C->>V: Hangs up or closes the tab
  alt Normal finish
    V->>API: POST /api/calls/id/end
  else Tab closed
    V->>API: sendBeacon finish request
  else No request arrives
    API->>API: Scheduled sweep closes idle calls
  end
  API->>DB: State CALL_COMPLETED, finish time, duration
  API-->>V: Accepted with brief status pending
  Note over DB: Turns were saved per turn, so nothing is lost
  API->>PC: Start processing
  PC->>DB: Save summary or mark failed
  V->>API: Poll brief status
  API-->>V: Caller-safe completion message
